    "title": "Gerald Williams, 17, missing from Mesa, police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "15 hours ago\nThe Mesa Police Department is seeking the public’s help in locating 17-year-old Gerald Williams who is missing and was last seen at 7:30 p.m. Sept. 9 in the area of Stapley and University Drive.\nHe was last seen wearing a gray hooded sweatshirt, green army T-shirt, black shoes and a black face mask.\nWilliams is a black male with brown hair, brown eyes, standing 5 feet 9 inches tall and weighing 220 pounds.\nIf you have any information or see Williams, call Mesa police at 480-644-2211.",
